@startuml Payout State Machine

skinparam backgroundColor #f5f6f1
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam stateBorderColor #c7cbb4
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam stateArrowColor #565f55
skinparam noteBorderColor #c7cbb4
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #f3e8d2

title Payout State Machine

state "PENDING" as PENDING
state "PENDING_COMPLIANCE" as PC #e4efe6
state "PENDING_MANUAL_REVIEW" as PMR #fff3e0
state "FUND_PULLING" as FP #fff3e0
state "SUBMITTED" as SUBMITTED
state "SUBMITTED_UNCONFIRMED" as UNCONF #f3e8d2
state "REFUND_REQUIRED" as RR #ffe8cc
state "REFUND_PENDING" as RP #fff3e0
state "SETTLED" as SETTLED #e4efe6         : Terminal
state "FUND_PULL_FAILED" as FPF #f1dcd6    : Terminal
state "FAILED" as FAILED #f1dcd6
state "RETURNED" as RETURNED #f1dcd6
state "REFUNDED" as REFUNDED #e4efe6       : Terminal
state "REFUND_FAILED" as RF #f1dcd6        : Terminal\n(manual intervention)
state "REJECTED_COMPLIANCE" as RC #f1dcd6  : Terminal
state "CANCELLED" as CANCELLED #f1dcd6     : Terminal

[*] --> PENDING : POST /payouts\n202 Accepted

PENDING --> PC        : compliance gate\nenabled for corridor
PENDING --> FP        : compliance gate\nnot required
PENDING --> CANCELLED : caller cancels\nbefore submission

PC --> FP  : fraud + AML pass (auto)
PC --> RC  : hard hit\n(SANCTIONS_MATCH,\nFRAUD_SCORE_EXCEEDED)
PC --> PMR : soft hit\n(PEP_DETECTED,\nPARTIAL_MATCH)

PMR --> FP : reviewer approves
PMR --> RC : reviewer rejects

note right of PC
  Runs AFTER 202 Accepted,
  BEFORE any funds move.
  Fraud + AML/sanctions
  run in sequence here.
end note

FP --> SUBMITTED   : pull succeeds\nfunds with Boku
FP --> FPF         : pull fails\n(INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS,\nMANDATE_REVOKED)

note right of FP
  Pull-and-Pay only.
  Prefunded wallet: skip
  FUND_PULLING — wallet
  debited at PENDING.
end note

note right of FPF
  No funds moved.
  No refund needed.
  Caller's account
  was never debited.
end note

SUBMITTED --> SETTLED : rail confirms\nfunds delivered
SUBMITTED --> FAILED  : rail rejects\n(non-retryable)
SUBMITTED --> RETURNED : rail accepted,\nlater reversed
SUBMITTED --> UNCONF  : connection dropped\n(outcome unknown)

UNCONF --> SETTLED : partner lookup\nresolves: settled
UNCONF --> FAILED  : partner lookup\nresolves: failed

note right of UNCONF
  NOT the same as FAILED.
  Must query partner via
  client_reference first —
  no failover until resolved,
  no refund until resolved.
end note

' Refund path — Pull-and-Pay only
' Every FAILED/RETURNED from SUBMITTED means funds were pulled (FUND_PULLING passed)
' Option A — immediate event-driven refund
FAILED   --> RP : [immediate]\nPull-and-Pay:\nevent-driven refund
RETURNED --> RP : [immediate]\nPull-and-Pay:\nevent-driven refund
UNCONF   --> RP : [immediate]\nlookup resolves failed

' Option B — batch job via REFUND_REQUIRED (dashed = optional design)
FAILED   -[dashed]-> RR : [batch]\nPull-and-Pay:\nflag for batch job
RETURNED -[dashed]-> RR : [batch]\nPull-and-Pay:\nflag for batch job
UNCONF   -[dashed]-> RR : [batch]\nlookup resolves failed
RR       -[dashed]-> RP : Refund Batch Job\npicks up record\n(SELECT FOR UPDATE\nSKIP LOCKED)

note right of RR
  Optional intermediate state.
  Trade-off: user satisfaction
  (immediate) vs system safety
  (batch — rate-controlled,
  observable, safe under burst).
  Dashed lines = batch path.
end note

note right of RP
  Pull-and-Pay only.
  If SUBMITTED was reached,
  funds are always with Boku —
  no flag check needed.
  Prefunded wallet: internal
  credit, no new state.
end note

RP --> REFUNDED : refund to caller\nsucceeds
RP --> RF       : refund to caller\nalso fails

note right of RF
  Serious ops incident:
  money with Boku — not with
  beneficiary or caller.
  Page oncall immediately.
  Manual resolution required.
end note

note right of RC
  NOT the same as FAILED.
  Legal/policy block.
  No funds moved —
  no refund required.
  May trigger regulatory
  reporting obligation.
end note

SETTLED   --> [*]
REFUNDED  --> [*]
FPF       --> [*]
RF        --> [*]
RC        --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

@enduml
